      "valueMarkdown": "Preventive Care and Wellness (All-or-nothing) test case. Nate (72) has an existing diagnosis of hypertension, which excludes his encounters from the blood pressure screening component, and colon cancer, which excludes him from colorectal cancer screening. He has not received pneumococcal vaccination. These ongoing conditions are not limited life expectancy conditions, so they do not make him a tobacco screening denominator exception. Component status: BCS: n/a; HBP: excluded; CCS: excluded; PVS: not met; TSC group 1: met; TSC group 2: n/a. Expected not to meet the composite numerator: at least one component in whose denominator they remain is not met."
